%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56d596c8d8b1a3f4e8b6c1601d9cdc15, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 61312303640576
    m_Localized: she's on the shelf over the stove now. i dust her. don't tell Orik i dust her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000704
    m_Localized: is that... you found her! give her here. careful. no, carefuller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000705
    m_Localized: not a scratch on her. well. the usual number of scratches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000706
    m_Localized: so what's the research, Boog?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000707
    m_Localized: she's all yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000708
    m_Localized: ...she's the first thing i ever made that went off when i meant her to. before her, things went off when they wanted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000709
    m_Localized: Old Phi let me keep her. she said everyone needs one thing that does what they hoped it would.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000710
    m_Localized: here. for your trouble. i was saving it for fuses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000711
    m_Localized: you went all the way down for her. i won't forget it, keeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000712
    m_Localized: any sign of her? round, black, smoking a little. she won't come if you call.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000713
    m_Localized: i'll keep looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000714
    m_Localized: first floor of the Cellars, a couple of fights in. that's where the spiders and i disagreed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000715
    m_Localized: i lost something in the Hollows. my favorite bomb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000716
    m_Localized: your favorite bomb?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000717
    m_Localized: where did you lose her?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000718
    m_Localized: you don't have a favorite bomb? huh. well, she's mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000719
    m_Localized: in the Cellars, first floor, a couple of fights in. the spiders and i had a disagreement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000720
    m_Localized: will you bring her back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000721
    m_Localized: i'll bring her back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000722
    m_Localized: what do you need her for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000723
    m_Localized: not now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000724
    m_Localized: you will? she's round, black, and her fuse is still going. that's normal. don't worry about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000725
    m_Localized: research.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000726
    m_Localized: what research?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000727
    m_Localized: the private kind. will you look or not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000728
    m_Localized: she'll keep. she's very patient, for a bomb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000729
    m_Localized: you hung the Larder Troll's tusks over the bar. i've been looking at them for an hour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000730
    m_Localized: if the stove catches fire again, they're the first thing i'm saving. after the bomb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000731
    m_Localized: they do look good up there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000732
    m_Localized: they look terrifying. that's what good looks like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000733
    m_Localized: again? the stove's been on fire?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000734
    m_Localized: only the once. twice. it's fine, i was there both times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000735
    m_Localized: the hatch is in the floor. you can't miss it. people do miss it, and then they fall in. that works too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000736
    m_Localized: the stove's hot. the stove's always hot. that's how you know it's working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000737
    m_Localized: about your bomb...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000738
    m_Localized: carry on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000739
    m_Localized: the tusks over the bar are a talking point. a guest asked if they bite. i said only on weekends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000740
    m_Localized: do they?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000741
    m_Localized: i haven't checked. i'm not going to check.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000742
    m_Localized: the hatch is in the floor. i'll be up here, counting things. it's what i'm for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000743
    m_Localized: Boog's bomb is home. i've entered it in the incident book. in advance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000744
    m_Localized: good evening, [lua(HH_PlayerName())]. the ledger and i are on speaking terms again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000745
    m_Localized: tell me about Phi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000746
    m_Localized: why won't you go down?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000747
    m_Localized: how are the books?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000748
    m_Localized: never mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000749
    m_Localized: we rebuilt this place together, long ago. she'd been one of the Fortunate Five. the road kept calling her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000750
    m_Localized: my family went down for three hundred years. somebody had to come up and count what they left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000751
    m_Localized: in the red. a cheerful sort of red. we've had worse reds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000752
    m_Localized: ahh, you must be [lua(HH_PlayerName())]! Phi's letter said you'd come. it didn't say you'd be this late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000753
    m_Localized: the road was long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000754
    m_Localized: where is Phi'rai?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000755
    m_Localized: that's the question, isn't it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000756
    m_Localized: nine days ago she went down into the Hollows. she said a week at most. Phi is never late. never, in all these years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000757
    m_Localized: her letter says if she isn't back, Tally Ho! is yours to keep. so you're the keeper now. i'm Orik. i keep the books.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000758
    m_Localized: and i'm Boog! i keep the fire. mostly in the stove.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000759
    m_Localized: Boog cooks. Boog also keeps a list of the things he's set alight. it's longer than the menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000760
    m_Localized: and we can't open without food. the storeroom holds three onions and a smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000761
    m_Localized: the smell's mine. i'm keeping it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000762
    m_Localized: but the hatch is right there! down in the Hollows, everything's an ingredient if you're brave about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000763
    m_Localized: i don't go down. my family went down for three hundred years. i came up. i'm staying up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000764
    m_Localized: bring back anything with meat on it. or teeth. i can work with teeth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000765
    m_Localized: i'll go down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000766
    m_Localized: you're back! and you brought... let me see. oh. oh, that's a whole supper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000767
    m_Localized: i've counted it. by my sums that's an evening. a small one, but an evening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000768
    m_Localized: you see? the Hollows go in, supper comes out. that's all cooking is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000769
    m_Localized: Phi used to come up that hatch smelling just like you do now. i never asked what of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000770
    m_Localized: what else did she bring up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000771
    m_Localized: what do i smell like?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000772
    m_Localized: answers, sometimes. never to anything i'd asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000773
    m_Localized: deep. you smell deep. it's a good smell on a cook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000774
    m_Localized: you're back! that's the important part. the other important part was food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000775
    m_Localized: the Hollows keep what you drop. the books are taking it well. so am i.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000776
    m_Localized: tomorrow we fry the onions and serve them with confidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000777
    m_Localized: sleep. we open tomorrow evening. i'll have the board ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000778
    m_Localized: the board is yours. pick tonight's dishes from what's in the storeroom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000779
    m_Localized: you cook at the stations, put it on the pass, carry it to whoever's hungry. want me on a station? just say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000780
    m_Localized: they pay when they're fed. i'll be on the floor too. try not to be slower than me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000781
    m_Localized: that's the first night's takings. Phi's first night was worse. i have it written down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000782
    m_Localized: she used to say the first night is for finding out what's wrong with the second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61312333000783
    m_Localized: keeper. can i ask you something? a small thing. a medium thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111848087552
    m_Localized: you killed the Larder Troll. the actual Larder Troll. the one that eats the Cellars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807808
    m_Localized: first my bomb, now the troll. you're the best thing to happen to this kitchen since the stove.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807809
    m_Localized: i've said for years it was edible. now it's dead, and i'm right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807810
    m_Localized: is it edible?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807811
    m_Localized: it nearly ate me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807812
    m_Localized: parts of it. the brave parts. i'll find out which.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807813
    m_Localized: nearly. best word in the language.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807814
    m_Localized: i told her about you. the bomb. i tell her things. she's a good listener, for a bomb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807815
    m_Localized: someone asked for something special and got it. i heard them say thank you. over the stove. the stove's loud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807816
    m_Localized: i saw you at the block. clean cuts. you didn't flinch at the gristle. i flinch at the gristle, and i love gristle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807817
    m_Localized: you could work my stove. don't. but you could.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807818
    m_Localized: the Larder Troll is dead. i've moved it from 'risks' to 'resolved'. first entry in that column in years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807819
    m_Localized: Phi went after it, you know. twice. she came back both times and wouldn't say a word about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807820
    m_Localized: what was she after?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807821
    m_Localized: she'll come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807822
    m_Localized: not the troll, she said. whatever it was sitting on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807823
    m_Localized: she always has. i keep her chair dusted. don't tell Boog i dust things. he'll want to compare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807824
    m_Localized: you remembered that patron's request, and made it. people come back to places that remember them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141111906807825
    m_Localized: Phi ran it that way. i'd started to think i was the only one who remembered how.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 168473641889792
    m_Localized: she left, and i kept it open without her for years. when the Hollows turned bad, i left too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 168473700610048
    m_Localized: decades later she came home, found me, and said i was late for work. so i came back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056222302208
    m_Localized: Phi'rai. Old Phi, to anyone who wanted to keep their teeth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439552
    m_Localized: five tankards, polished, on a shelf nobody drinks from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439553
    m_Localized: the cellar hatch. the Hollows can wait for dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439554
    m_Localized: Karias. the letters are worn smooth where people touch them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439555
    m_Localized: that's five. the village is putting its boots by the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 207056268439556
    m_Localized: we open when you say so. i'll be here, counting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
